// sfn/codegen-llvm — toolchain-internal LLVM lowering provider facade.
//
// Callers supply verified Sailfin IR plus a driver-resolved provider context.
// This capsule returns LLVM text and diagnostic data; the compiler driver owns
// target discovery, persistent artifact I/O, assembly, process execution, and
// final linking.
